Z||000018||RobH||06-01-2000||11:41 PM||||Speaking of leaving them looking "bumpy", I bead blasted mine and then painted them with black Rustoleum Hammered Finish paint.  Left a textured finish, but very shiny.  Not sure if I like the shine since the rest of the car is dull/flat, but the texture is nice.  Paint seems to be pretty tough too.||||reg||1
